1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,000
The shop that sells the spray
often gives the advice too.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Kom Bish tells a rice farmer
whether to spray at all.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,000
[App] Kom Bish is a computer program,
not a government officer.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,000
[App] We do not keep your photo
or your voice recording.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:20,000
[App] We keep only the disease and
the advice, with no name or number.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,000
[App] Tick if you agree.

7
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:27,000
The farmer uploads a leaf photo.
(Sample image: RiceLeafBD test split)

8
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:30,000
[App] Do the yellow or straw-coloured
patches start at the leaf tip or edge

9
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,000
and run down along the edge?
(The farmer answers yes.)

10
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:37,000
[App] No insecticide needed,
fix the fertiliser

11
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:41,000
[App voice] It looks like
bacterial leaf blight.

12
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:46,000
[App voice] Insecticide does not
cure it, so don't buy any.

13
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:50,000
[App voice] Stop urea for now.

14
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:56,000
[App voice] After the rain, per bigha:
5 kg potash and 3.5 kg gypsum.

15
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:01,000
[App voice] Before spraying anything
else, talk to your agriculture officer.

16
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:05,000
A second photo looks like blast.
(Sample image: Paddy Doctor held-out)

17
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:11,000
[App] Are the spots long like an eye,
narrow ends, grey centre, brown edge?

18
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:14,000
Only a "yes" gives spray advice.

19
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:18,000
[App] A spray is needed,
but done correctly

20
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:24,000
[App voice] A tricyclazole-group
fungicide. Dose: follow the packet.

21
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:29,000
[App voice] Long sleeves, gloves,
wind at your back. Wash afterwards.

22
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:33,000
A third photo is unclear.

23
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:39,000
[App] I can't be sure from this photo.
Call 16123 or your local officer.

24
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:44,000
When it is not sure,
Kom Bish does not guess.

25
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:50,000
Tested on photos from Bangladesh,
India and the Philippines.

26
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:56,000
Code, live demo and evaluation:
links on screen
